      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Licenses and free trials are now confirmed by Game Bridge&#x27;s server, which keeps your subscription safe and working. Your first launch needs an internet connection once to start the free trial.</p>]]></description>
