      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Games that play videos (intros, cutscenes, animated menus) no longer get stuck on a black screen: Game Bridge&#x27;s Wine now includes video support. Game Bridge downloads the updated Wine (about 110 MB) once after this update.</p>]]></description>
